  "description": "Single and two storey side extension; Single storey rear extension",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The scale of the proposed works, the visual impact of the proposed works on the streetscene, and poor design quality of the proposed works would be unduly obtrusive and incongruous, would undermine the established character and appearance of the existing dwellinghouse, and would fail to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the area. The proposal is therefore contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
